  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of Sea Turtle Conservation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The recipient will 1. monitor and evaluate beach and nest temperatures in hatcheries and on nesting beach, 2. evaluate and compare hatchling sex ratios in hatcheries and in situ nests, 3. evaluate predation of arribada nesting and solitary nesting, 4. evaluate type and abundance of predators at Rancho Nuevo nesting beach, 5. evaluate emergence rate and survival rate to sea of hatchlings from arribada nests and solitary nests, 6. develop an effective strategy for leaving nests in situ at Rancho Nuevo, and 7. evaluate 15 years of temperature data to examine long term temperature changes at Rancho Nuevo to predict potential impacts of climate change.</narrative>
  </description>
